direction: right
User: Resource owner {shape: person}
Browser: Browser {shape: page}
Client: Client application {shape: rectangle}
Auth: Authorization server {shape: hexagon}
API: Resource server {shape: rectangle}
UserDB: Identity store {shape: cylinder}
User -> Browser
Browser -> Client: start sign-in
Client -> Auth: authorize request
Auth -> UserDB: authenticate
Auth -> Browser: authorization code
Browser -> Client: redirect with code
Client -> Auth: code and verifier
Auth -> Client: access token
Client -> API: bearer token
API -> Auth: validate token
